'' AN INSTANTIATION REACHED THROUGH A MODULE'S 'using' IS WRITTEN QUALIFIED IN ITS INTERFACE.
'' box writes 'using ns' and 'as G( of long )'; the interface does not repeat the using, and
'' an instantiation is typed with its instance but bound to no symbol, so it was written bare
'' and the importer reported TKO0808 "the type 'g' is not declared" (std/strings, 2026-10-10:
'' 'as Array( of string )' after 'using FB').
